SUMMARY:Deadline: Galerie Noord: Dertig Dertigers 2027 (Groningen\, artists
  aged 30 to 39)
DESCRIPTION:To open its 30th anniversary year\, Galerie Noord in Groningen 
 is staging Dertig Dertigers\, a group exhibition of thirty artists in thei
 r thirties\, each showing one work. All disciplines are welcome\; the prop
 osed work may measure no more than 120 x 120 x 120 cm. From the thirty\, a
  jury (Tsjalling Venema\, chair\; Margriet van Weenen\; Anika Mariam Ahmed
 ) picks one winner\, who receives EUR 1\,500 towards their practice and a 
 solo exhibition at the gallery in December 2027. ELIGIBILITY: artists livi
 ng in the Netherlands\, born between 2 January 1987 and 1 January 1997. AP
 PLICATION: via the online form linked from the call PDF\, which also holds
  the full terms and image specifications. DEADLINE: Saturday 31 October 20
 26\, 23:59. Selected artists are announced 27 November 2026\; work is deli
 vered 18 or 19 December 2026\; the exhibition runs 2 January to 10 Februar
 y 2027\, with the winner announced at the opening on 9 January 2027.\n\nOr
 ganisation: Stichting Galerie Noord\nLocation: Galerie Noord\, Nieuwstad 6
 \, Groningen\, Netherlands. Open to artists living in the Netherlands born
  between 2 January 1987 and 1 January 1997 (aged 30 to 39 on 1 January 202
 7).\nAward: One winner receives a EUR 1\,500 contribution towards their ar
 tistic practice plus a solo exhibition at Galerie Noord (11 December 2027 
 to 13 January 2028). Thirty selected artists each show one work in the gro
 up exhibition\; no fee for the other 29 is stated. No application fee ment
 ioned.\nDuration: Group exhibition 2 January to 10 February 2027\; winner'
 s solo exhibition 11 December 2027 to 13 January 2028\n\nMore: https://www
 .galerienoord.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2914_NOORD_Open-Call_Dertig-De
 rtigers_A4_ENG.pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referr
 al
URL:https://www.galerienoord.nl/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/2914_NOORD_Open-
 Call_Dertig-Dertigers_A4_ENG.pdf?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm
 _medium=referral
LOCATION:Galerie Noord\, Nieuwstad 6\, Groningen\, Netherlands. Open to art
 ists living in the Netherlands born between 2 January 1987 and 1 January 1
 997 (aged 30 to 39 on 1 January 2027).
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
